    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Experience the enchanting journey of Diogo Ramos, a Brazilian artist from São Paulo, skillfully blending Brazil's musical heritage with modern urban vibes. The ever-evolving artist unveils his latest album, Cabaça, a captivating fusion of electro-samba-funk! \n\nJoin the musical revolution with Diogo Ramos to taste the pulsating rhythms of Brazil and the artistic diversity of Montreal and beyond! \n\n-\n\nMeet Diogo Ramos, singer-songwriter hailing from São Paulo, Brazil. Rooted in the rich tradition of Brazilian popular musicians, Diogo has honed his craft since the age..."
      }
